Description:It is your first main phase. You control Mutavault ({T}: {C}; {1}: it becomes a 2/2 creature until end of turn) and Wastes, both untapped. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-manland-tapped-for-mana | An animated land that has been yours all turn can attack, but not if it is tapped (CR 302.6, 508.1a): pay Mutavault's {1} with the Wastes and attack for 2; tapping Mutavault for its own activation leaves it unable to attack
